WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.000
Meet Qalam. Type Arabic the way you spell it.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.400
Install it, and a short setup turns on the keyboard and picks your style.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.400
Type each letter, then its haraka. Sukūn and shadda appear by themselves.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.400
Long phrases too: hamza, the article and Qur'anic marks are done for you.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.900
Suggestions appear as you type. Arrows choose, Space puts it in.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.900
Turn sukūn or harakat off with one shortcut.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Free for Mac and Windows. Get it at sashakib.github.io/qalam
